Z||000005||Cozmo||09-25-2001||10:51 AM||||MR2s are fine cars, and the engine is in the right place too. Yesterday I had a sweet white 2nd. gen pull up next to me at a stoplight, it had very nice lines and it sounded good!<BR>First and foremost I think Fieros are wonderful examples of American design but they suffer from poor execution and corporate cost-cutting.  That's why we (as Fiero affectionados) love them because we can MAKE them into what they should have been originally.<BR>Don't get me wrong, I have a yard full of Fieros but there IS a place for a 2nd. gen. MR2 in the "stable".<BR>I consider both cars to be more similiar than different...<P> <P>------------------<BR>     <B>BobC</B><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/targsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
